All units used internally in code shall be SI-units: kilograms, meters, meters per second, kelvins, radians, radians per second, volts, ampères, watts, ohms, farads, henries, etc. 

For final results, as well as monitoring and diagnostics, other units can be used for interpretation, but the internal processing should always be done consistently SI to avoid errors.

Coordinate system: x0=y0=z0=0
